        "created_at": "2015-04-25T18:08:53.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Another example is that card of Fanatic's (might be Divine Focus but I might be getting my cards mixed up) which lets her discard to hit stuff at the start of every turn. So she can do it at the start of the villain's turn, the environment's turn, and each individual hero's turn, including her own.</p>",
